---
source: crates/notify/tests/payloads.rs
expression: email_snapshot(&down)
---
to: owner@example.com
subject: CodoSEO: We couldn't reach example.com: connection refused
--- text ---
Site unreachable · example.com
We couldn't reach example.com: connection refused

Twice in a row the site could not be crawled. Until it answers, nothing can be checked.

- What to check: DNS, the firewall, and that robots.txt or the host doesn't block CodoSEObot.
- What we do next: We keep trying on the weekly schedule and tell you when it answers.
- If the site moved: Change the start URL in the site's settings.

Open the site in CodoSEO:
https://codoseo.com/sites/abc

Sent to an alert channel on CodoSEO.

CodoSEO by SafrowLabs · https://codoseo.com

